# G8: the same pointer actions made through the real INT 33h of DOSBox's mouse driver (dos/tools/mouse-x11.sh moves a pointer inside a
# virtual X server with xdotool). Places are pixels. The run's last frame before it exits must be this scenario's last frame.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 60 151
@drag 150 210 330 210
